// Inherit the parent event
event_inherited();

array_push(_dialogs, $"Hey you, Laura's got a strawberry cheesecake out this morning if you fancy a change from your usual?");
array_push(_dialogs, $"Ah, yeah, we saw the email last night. Stayed up late looking over the finances. Never know who'll move into those food courts. Gotta plan for the worst. It would be a shame to not be able to pass the cafe down to the kids…");
array_push(_dialogs, $"I remember the day we moved here. I was so mad at my da. Ma was barely in the ground before he uprooted us to this random town in the middle of nowhere to open a chippy. Ha. I found out later that they used to holiday here when they first married. The big softie. Now I couldn't imagine having done anything else with my life…");
array_push(_dialogs, $"I'll scatter some about the cafe. Laura and I can hopefully encourage some signatures. And if that doesn't work, then we can bribe them wi cake. Ha!");